@startuml
skinparam rectangle {
    roundCorner 25
}

rectangle "开始" as Start #Lavender
rectangle "待处理数据" as Data #Green
rectangle "可信知识匹配" as Match #SkyBlue
rectangle "判断" as Decision #Beige
rectangle "可信度判断" as Credibility #LightSteelBlue
rectangle "roberta-mnli\n矛盾程度判断" as Roberta #LightGray
rectangle "决策树判定" as DecisionTree #Beige
rectangle "知识库" as KnowledgeBase #Green
rectangle "丢弃" as Discard #LightGreen
rectangle "下次迭代再做处理" as NextIteration #LightGreen
rectangle "结束" as End #Lavender

Start -down-> Data
Data -right-> Match
Match -down-> Decision
Decision -right-> NextIteration : 无相关知识
Decision -down-> Roberta : 有相关知识, R
Decision -> Credibility : 有相关知识, R
Roberta -down-> DecisionTree : 矛盾度: contradiction_flag, 结果置信度: score_of_contradiction
DecisionTree -down-> KnowledgeBase : 合格
DecisionTree -right-> Discard : 不合格
KnowledgeBase -down-> End : 数据全部处理完毕
NextIteration -up-> Credibility : 不再迭代, R=-1, lambda=1
Credibility -down-> DecisionTree : 可信flag: C, 结果置信度: CS

@enduml
